flowchart LR
    SI[Strategy intent and RuntimeExecutionPlan] --> PC[Startup policy conformance]
    IC[InstrumentExecutionContract] --> RC[ResolvedExecutionContext]
    VP[VenueExecutionProfile] --> RC
    FS[FeeSchedule] --> RC
    EM[ExecutionModelArtifact] --> RC
    RC --> PC
    PC --> RS[Immutable run snapshot and context bundle]
    RS --> EX[Canonical bar execution]
    EX --> CF[Canonical fills and accounting]
    CF --> EV[Runtime events and BotLens facts]
    EV --> RP[Report context verification and X0-X2 assessment]

    PA[Provider and venue data registry] -. identity only .-> IC
    PA -. not execution authority .-> VP
    OL[Durable canonical order lifecycle] --> EX
    L2[L2 replay queue and latency] -. separate capability .-> EX
    LIVE[External order submission] -. prohibited by ADR 0049 .-> EX
